<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In I-FailSense: Towards General Robotic Failure Detection with Vision-Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">VII </span><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Ablation Study</span></span></a></li>
